# AARR Engineering AI Roadmap

## Phase 1 — Engineering AI Tools
- Surveying and GIS
- BOQ and Estimation
- Roads and Infrastructure
- Structural Engineering
- Construction and Site Reports
- Technical AI Assistant

## Phase 2 — Digital Engineering Library
- CAD drawings, templates, and technical documents
- Categorized resources and search
- Paid downloads for authorized materials

## Phase 3 — Secure Platform
- Customer accounts and subscriptions
- Secure payment verification
- Protected file downloads
- Customer support and administration

## Phase 4 — Backend and Testing
- Connect an AI service through a secure backend
- Keep API keys out of public website files
- Validate engineering calculations and uploaded files
- Test security, performance, and mobile compatibility

## Important
This file is a planning document only. It does not activate AI tools, payments, or customer accounts. All engineering outputs require appropriate professional verification.
